WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.597
CLINT BARTON
I made a whole lot of enemies.

00:00:02.648 --> 00:00:03.837
Tracksuit Mafia.

00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:06.231
Even a Black Widow.

00:00:06.281 --> 00:00:07.148
KATE BISHOP
That doesn't sound good.

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.219
KAZI
Tell the boss Christmas came early.

00:00:17.277 --> 00:00:18.143
YELENA BELOVA
Hi!

00:00:18.659 --> 00:00:21.396
